{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>About the Huntsman Demo</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo contains the opening areas for the full Huntsman experience, allowing you to experience the early story, multiple spider encounters and several puzzles to overcome as you journey through the Atherton Labs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Forget. Everything. And. Run. FEAR the Huntsman</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience  one of humanity's most primal fears in Huntsman, a survival horror that will immerse you in the creeping dread and crawling terror\u00a0of arachnophobia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/acfdbcf376dd50fd2a1b03ab706034a2.poster.avif?t=1759423450\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/acfdbcf376dd50fd2a1b03ab706034a2.webm?t=1759423450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/acfdbcf376dd50fd2a1b03ab706034a2.mp4?t=1759423450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new security guard at Atherton Laboratories, chaos erupts as\u00a0eight-legged predators infest the hallways. Outnumbered and defenseless, you must find a way to eliminate the threats and lift the facility lockdown to escape. Will you survive, or become the spider's next prey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/8f7322fe9e751332959ddc9eb0355b61.poster.avif?t=1759423450\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/8f7322fe9e751332959ddc9eb0355b61.webm?t=1759423450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/8f7322fe9e751332959ddc9eb0355b61.mp4?t=1759423450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend into the Web -\u00a0</strong>Explore a facility overrun by invasive predators. Divert limited power between sections of the building to access new areas, gather vital resources, and outmaneuver the swarm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/fcf4bc2444f013a3b00dcc259dfc7b4c.poster.avif?t=1759423450\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/fcf4bc2444f013a3b00dcc259dfc7b4c.webm?t=1759423450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/fcf4bc2444f013a3b00dcc259dfc7b4c.mp4?t=1759423450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improvise or Die</strong> -\u00a0Use your flashlight, throwables, and the environment itself to distract, mislead, and evade the deadliest creatures you've ever faced. Just remember: one wrong move, and you're prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/250a4e12a6c93943cb81a3d120a8940a.poster.avif?t=1759423450\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/250a4e12a6c93943cb81a3d120a8940a.webm?t=1759423450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/250a4e12a6c93943cb81a3d120a8940a.mp4?t=1759423450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fear Has Eight Legs -\u00a0</strong>Experience arachnophobia like never before! Each spider moves, hunts, and reacts with terrifying realism triggering primal instincts your mind won\u2019t be able to ignore.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967870?t=1759423450","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/6492168311374b3abaf029061fbedda7b32464c0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759423450","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/6b6bcc67852f0a2b9d3d93377eb6fd60a62a75e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759423450","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/6b6bcc67852f0a2b9d3d93377eb6fd60a62a75e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759423450","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>About the Huntsman Demo</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo contains the opening areas for the full Huntsman experience, allowing you to experience the early story, multiple spider encounters and several puzzles to overcome as you journey through the Atherton Labs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Forget. Everything. And. Run. FEAR the Huntsman</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience  one of humanity's most primal fears in Huntsman, a survival horror that will immerse you in the creeping dread and crawling terror\u00a0of arachnophobia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/acfdbcf376dd50fd2a1b03ab706034a2.poster.avif?t=1759423450\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/acfdbcf376dd50fd2a1b03ab706034a2.webm?t=1759423450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/acfdbcf376dd50fd2a1b03ab706034a2.mp4?t=1759423450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new security guard at Atherton Laboratories, chaos erupts as\u00a0eight-legged predators infest the hallways. Outnumbered and defenseless, you must find a way to eliminate the threats and lift the facility lockdown to escape. Will you survive, or become the spider's next prey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/8f7322fe9e751332959ddc9eb0355b61.poster.avif?t=1759423450\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/8f7322fe9e751332959ddc9eb0355b61.webm?t=1759423450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/8f7322fe9e751332959ddc9eb0355b61.mp4?t=1759423450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend into the Web -\u00a0</strong>Explore a facility overrun by invasive predators. Divert limited power between sections of the building to access new areas, gather vital resources, and outmaneuver the swarm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/fcf4bc2444f013a3b00dcc259dfc7b4c.poster.avif?t=1759423450\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/fcf4bc2444f013a3b00dcc259dfc7b4c.webm?t=1759423450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/fcf4bc2444f013a3b00dcc259dfc7b4c.mp4?t=1759423450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improvise or Die</strong> -\u00a0Use your flashlight, throwables, and the environment itself to distract, mislead, and evade the deadliest creatures you've ever faced. Just remember: one wrong move, and you're prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/250a4e12a6c93943cb81a3d120a8940a.poster.avif?t=1759423450\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/250a4e12a6c93943cb81a3d120a8940a.webm?t=1759423450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/extras/250a4e12a6c93943cb81a3d120a8940a.mp4?t=1759423450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fear Has Eight Legs -\u00a0</strong>Experience arachnophobia like never before! Each spider moves, hunts, and reacts with terrifying realism triggering primal instincts your mind won\u2019t be able to ignore.</p>","developers":["OnTheHouse Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3814680","name":"Huntsman"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967870/d0dcc212e6e2b8bc3330449bd39351a8f90c65b3/header.jpg?t=1759423450","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3967870/123458415/aab1b6c8c6db7c0bc768f06a501515cec7e9a14a/1758711780/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759080521","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3967870/123458415/aab1b6c8c6db7c0bc768f06a501515cec7e9a14a/1758711780/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759080521","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3967870/123458415/aab1b6c8c6db7c0bc768f06a501515cec7e9a14a/1758711780/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759080521","id":257205373,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205373/movie480.mp4?t=1759080521","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205373/movie_max.mp4?t=1759080521"},"name":"Huntsman | Gameplay, Demo and Launch Date Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257205373/341722973ea984024f9cb33517b783c8baf16bea/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759080521","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205373/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1759080521","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205373/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1759080521"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3967870/35663893/d2a73187a3ee50fe21b04f45d7954efed3f08dea/1756209715/dash_av1.